      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, the Vulkan update call itself does not operate on the command buffer and does operate on the set directly. I may have misled Nelson here - I saw we only call `UpdateDescriptorSet` (or AFAICT call the methods to do so) from within the `VulkanCommandBuffer` at the same time we perform the bind operation, but I suppose there is nothing preventing us from calling this whilst a prior command buffer is performing a bind call, so I think you\u0027re right.",
